---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Oculivo Features | Eye Care Practice Management" description="Explore Oculivo scheduling, patient, clinical, optical, billing, communications, document, staff, and reporting workflows.">
<main class="wrap page"><span>Product</span><h1>Everything the practice needs, connected.</h1><div class="grid">{['Scheduling & appointments','Patients & intake','Clinical records','Optical inventory & orders','Insurance claims','Invoices & payments','Email, SMS, phone & fax','Documents & e-signatures','Team Chat','Time clock & staff','Reporting & automation','AI assistant'].map(x=><article><h2>{x}</h2><p>Built into the same tenant-secured Oculivo workspace so staff can move between workflows without losing patient or office context.</p></article>)}</div></main>
</Base>
<style>.page{padding:72px 0}.page>span{color:#168d89;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}.page h1{font-size:52px;letter-spacing:-.04em;max-width:760px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.grid article{background:white;border:1px solid #d8e8ee;border-radius:16px;padding:22px}.grid h2{font-size:20px}.grid p{color:#5d7581;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.page h1{font-size:40px}}</style>
